  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OHCHR to support the ongoing monitoring of and accountability for human rights violations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An&#xA0;additional contribution to Office of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights (OHCHR) Ukraine related work. This is&#xA0;additional&#xA0;to the core funding that NZ provides.
OHCHR has two Ukraine-focused mechanisms- the Human Rights Monitoring Mechanism in Ukraine &amp;amp; the recently-established Commission of Inquiry&#xA0;in the context of the Russian Federation&#x2019;s aggression against Ukraine.&#xA0;OHCHR has the discretion to allocate&#xA0;additional funds to one or both of the Ukraine-focused mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
